              <td>210 cal</td>
              <td><strong>33g</strong></td>
              <td>4g Fat / 2g Carbs</td>
              <td><strong class="text-emerald-600">15.71g / 100 cal</strong></td>
              <td>⚡ Pure Keto Muscle Fuel</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><a href="/items/original-cheeseburger"><strong>Original Single Cheeseburger</strong></a></td>
